{
  "id": "hou-zi-de-shou-tao",
  "title": "猴子的手套",
  "cover": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/06.jpg",
  "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/01.jpg",
  "theme": "#FFA726",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "猴子捡到一双手套，它模仿人类戴在手上，还向小伙伴炫耀。",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/01.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "这时，一只老虎来到山上，猴子们都躲到树上，",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/02.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "而戴手套的猴子抓不住树干，怎么也爬不上树，它急得满身大汗。",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/03.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "树上的小伙伴喊道：“快把手套摘下来！”",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/04.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "猴子马上摘掉手套，",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/05.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "终于爬上大树摆脱了困境。",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/06.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "从此，小猴子再也不乱模仿别人了。",
          "image": "images/hou-zi-de-shou-tao/07.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "newChars": [
    "急",
    "摆",
    "脱",
    "困",
    "境"
  ],
  "words": [
    "摆脱",
    "困境"
  ],
  "pinyinOverrides": {
    "树干": "shù gàn",
    "急得": "jí de"
  }
}